                "url": null,
                "publishedAt": null,
                "snippet": "Consumer Credit Policy\n3.2 Credit score bands, debt-to-income and loan-to-value limits\n3.3 Income and identity verification\nIncome must be verified before approval with the two most recent pay stubs, the last two years of tax returns for self-employed borrowers, or benefit award letters for retirees. Identity is verified under the Bank’s Customer Identification Program described in the KYC and AML procedure. A loan may not fund until both are complete.",
