                "title": "consumer_credit_policy.pdf",
                "url": null,
                "publishedAt": null,
                "snippet": "Consumer Credit Policy\n4. Pricing\nRates follow a five-tier risk-based pricing grid that maps one-to-one to the credit bands: Tier A for Exceptional through Tier E for Poor. The Asset and Liability Committee reviews the grid each month and publishes it to branch lenders. A lender may not discount a rate by more than 25 basis points without regional credit officer approval, and no loan may be priced to a customer on the basis of a protected characteristic.",
